1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,804
Claude 永不封号？这个问号必须留着。
Claude, never banned? Keep that question mark.

2
00:00:03,824 --> 00:00:05,775
有人把环境整理工具，
CCBaga brings environment

3
00:00:05,795 --> 00:00:07,673
做成了 CCBaga。
tools into one app.

4
00:00:07,693 --> 00:00:09,554
GitHub 开源，核心
Open source on GitHub,

5
00:00:09,574 --> 00:00:11,883
分成 A、B 两个应用。
with two apps: A and B.

6
00:00:11,903 --> 00:00:15,588
A 管本地身份，B 是独立浏览器。
A manages local identities. B is a separate browser.

7
00:00:15,608 --> 00:00:17,939
清理之前先归档，
Archive first. Keep chats

8
00:00:17,959 --> 00:00:21,058
聊天和缓存按需保留。
and caches as needed.

9
00:00:21,078 --> 00:00:23,825
技能和配置，也能选择留下。
Skills and settings can stay in the workspace.

10
00:00:23,845 --> 00:00:27,753
这样换环境时，旧缓存不会混在一起。
This separates local state when changing workspaces.

11
00:00:27,773 --> 00:00:29,620
但本地归档，不会抹掉
Local archives do not erase

12
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:31,700
平台的服务端记录。
server-side records.

13
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:34,125
浏览器支持换指纹种子，
Rotate browser seeds,

14
00:00:34,145 --> 00:00:36,068
设置语言和时区。
and set language and timezone.

15
00:00:36,088 --> 00:00:37,505
独立配置目录，
A separate profile

16
00:00:37,525 --> 00:00:40,559
减少不同会话的本地数据混用。
keeps local session data apart.

17
00:00:40,579 --> 00:00:42,846
语言、时区和地区对齐，
Aligned regional settings make

18
00:00:42,866 --> 00:00:44,898
让配置更容易检查。
mismatches easier to inspect.

19
00:00:44,918 --> 00:00:46,615
再把浏览器读数，
Compare browser readings

20
00:00:46,635 --> 00:00:48,941
和真实网络出口对照。
with the real network exit.

21
00:00:48,961 --> 00:00:50,973
浏览器自报的地区，
Inspect reported regions

22
00:00:50,993 --> 00:00:53,411
得和出口实测一起看。
alongside the measured exit.

23
00:00:53,431 --> 00:00:57,863
实测项目都匹配，验证页才会变绿。
The page turns green only when measured checks match.

24
00:00:57,883 --> 00:01:01,986
但选地区，不会自动改变公网 IP。
Selecting a region does not change your public IP.

25
00:01:02,006 --> 00:01:03,992
全绿也不等于免封号，
Green checks do not guarantee

26
00:01:04,012 --> 00:01:06,179
项目自己写得很清楚。
account acceptance.

27
00:01:06,199 --> 00:01:07,776
也没有实测数据，
No measured ban-rate

28
00:01:07,796 --> 00:01:10,771
证明这套流程降低了封号率。
reduction is established here.

29
00:01:10,791 --> 00:01:13,111
它支持三大桌面系统，
Three desktop platforms.

30
00:01:13,131 --> 00:01:16,567
Windows 一个包就有 A 加 B。
One Windows installer has A+B.

31
00:01:16,587 --> 00:01:18,603
只管理自己的环境，
Manage your own environment.

32
00:01:18,623 --> 00:01:21,046
账号受限走官方申诉。
Appeal restrictions officially.

33
00:01:21,066 --> 00:01:22,668
把环境看清楚，
Inspect the environment.

34
00:01:22,688 --> 00:01:25,786
别把工具当成免封保证。
No tool guarantees no bans.
